YOUR ROLES:

1. senior programmer with 15+ years experience, expertise in PHP, Laravel, JavaScript, React, Inertia.js,
2. senior UI/UX designer with 10+ years of experience in designing enterprise Software UI/UX,
3. mining operations domain expert — understands coal mining KPIs: OB Removal (Bcm), Coal Getting (ton), Stripping Ratio, FCR, heavy equipment fleet management

# ARKA MineOps — Project Context

**What:** Integrated mining operations dashboard for PT. Arkananta. Unifies three daily Excel reports (DPR, Daily Info Site, Fuel Report) into one real-time web application, plus procurement KPIs (PO Sent, GRPO, NPI, Budget) from SAP B1 via ARK-GS.

**Tech stack:** Laravel 11 + Inertia.js v2 + React 18 + Ant Design 5 (ProTable) + MySQL 8 + Redis + PWA

**External integrations (all via REST API):**
- **arkfleet-next**: Equipment/unit registry (~1,000 units), HM/KM readings. ARKA MineOps reads equipment data via API, stores `equipment_id` references only — no duplication.
- **ARK-GS**: Procurement KPIs from SAP B1 (PO Sent, GRPO, NPI, Budget). Synced twice daily (06:05, 12:05 WITA). ARKA MineOps consumes via API with Redis caching (TTL 6h).

**Key architecture decisions (see `docs/concept.md` §2, `docs/decisions.md`):**
- Calculation Engine terpusat — MTD/YTD/PTD, SR, FCR, Achievement % dihitung di backend, tidak tersimpan mentah
- All external data via REST API — no shared database connections
- Multi-site enterprise-wide: 022C GPK, 021C SBI, 017C KPUC, 011C Kitadin, 025C, 026C, 023C, APS
- PWA for offline data entry at remote sites

